sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Experiment client
  participant O as order-service
  participant I as inventory-service
  participant P as payment-service mock
  participant N as notification-service mock
  Note over C,N: Baseline: direct Service DNS, synchronous HTTP, no mesh, no retry
  C->>O: POST /orders + X-Correlation-ID
  O->>I: POST /work (propagated correlation ID)
  I-->>O: 200 accepted
  O->>P: POST /work (2 s client timeout)
  alt payment_delay_ms=300
    P->>P: sleep 300 ms for this request only
    P-->>O: 200 accepted
  else fail=payment
    P-->>O: 503
    O-->>C: 502 rejected with dependency evidence
  else success
    P-->>O: 200 authorized mock
    O->>N: POST /work
    N-->>O: 200 accepted
    O-->>C: 201 accepted with dependency durations
  end
